{"id":"ad5b3b7a0990eed7351d672ea6695d341108e0d6","axis":"silent","repo":"TanStack/router","sha":"ad5b3b7a0990eed7351d672ea6695d341108e0d6","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/route-group-layout-full-path.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+'@tanstack/router-generator': patch","+---","+","+A pathless layout inside a route group (`routes/(group)/_layout.tsx`) or a route group's own layout (`routes/(group)/route.tsx`) is typed with the full path `'/'` in `FileRoutesByPath`, like the router gives it at runtime, instead of `''`. When no index route claims `/`, the layout also appears under `'/'` in `FileRoutesByFullPath` and `FileRoutesByTo`, as a pathless layout outside a group already does."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"e2e/react-router/basic-file-based/src/routeTree.gen.ts","lines":["@@ -1711,7 +1711,7 @@ declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {","     '/(group)/_layout': {","       id: '/(group)/_layout'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupLayoutRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"e2e/solid-router/basic-file-based/src/routeTree.gen.ts","lines":["@@ -1451,7 +1451,7 @@ declare module '@tanstack/solid-router' {","     '/(group)/_layout': {","       id: '/(group)/_layout'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupLayoutRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"e2e/vue-router/basic-file-based-jsx/src/routeTree.gen.ts","lines":["@@ -364,7 +364,7 @@ declare module '@tanstack/vue-router' {","     '/(group)/_layout': {","       id: '/(group)/_layout'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupLayoutRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"e2e/vue-router/basic-file-based-sfc/src/routeTree.gen.ts","lines":["@@ -454,7 +454,7 @@ declare module '@tanstack/vue-router' {","     '/(group)/_layout': {","       id: '/(group)/_layout'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupLayoutRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"examples/vue/basic-file-based-jsx/src/routeTree.gen.ts","lines":["@@ -364,7 +364,7 @@ declare module '@tanstack/vue-router' {","     '/(group)/_layout': {","       id: '/(group)/_layout'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupLayoutRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"examples/vue/basic-file-based-sfc/src/routeTree.gen.ts","lines":["@@ -454,7 +454,7 @@ declare module '@tanstack/vue-router' {","     '/(group)/_layout': {","       id: '/(group)/_layout'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupLayoutRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/router-generator/src/utils.ts","lines":["@@ -924,9 +924,10 @@ const inferPath = (routeNode: RouteNode): string => {"," }"," "," /**","- * Infers the full path for use by TS","+ * The full path with groups and pathless segments removed. A route group's","+ * layout (e.g. `/(group)/_layout`) strips down to `''`.","  */","-export const inferFullPath = (routeNode: RouteNode): string => {","+const stripFullPath = (routeNode: RouteNode): string => {","   const fullPath = removeGroups(","     removeLayoutSegmentsAndUnderscoresWithEscape(","       routeNode.routePath,","@@ -949,6 +950,13 @@ export const inferFullPath = (routeNode: RouteNode): string => {","   return fullPath.replace(/\\/$/, '')"," }"," ","+/**","+ * Infers the full path for use by TS","+ */","+export const inferFullPath = (routeNode: RouteNode): string =>","+  // A route group's layout has the router's full path `/`","+  stripFullPath(routeNode) || '/'","+"," const shouldPreferIndexRoute = (","   current: RouteNode,","   existing: RouteNode,","@@ -1112,8 +1120,12 @@ Conflicting files: \\n ${emptyPathRoutes","     throw new Error(errorMessage)","   }"," ","+  // A route group's layout keeps its stripped path `''` here, so one without","+  // child routes yet doesn't conflict with the index route. A childless","+  // `_auth.tsx` does: the route tree lists the index route first, and the","+  // router would then match `/` to the layout","   const routes = _routes.map((d) => {","-    const inferredFullPath = inferFullPath(d)","+    const inferredFullPath = stripFullPath(d)","     return { ...d, inferredFullPath }","   })"," "],"additions":15,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/router-generator/tests/childless-pathless-layout.test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,107 @@","+import fs from 'node:fs/promises'","+import os from 'node:os'","+import path from 'node:path'","+import { afterEach, describe, expect, it, test } from 'vitest'","+","+import { Generator, getConfig } from '../src'","+","+let tempDir: string | undefined","+","+afterEach(async () => {","+  if (tempDir) {","+    await fs.rm(tempDir, { recursive: true, force: true })","+    tempDir = undefined","+  }","+})","+","+function routeSource(id: string) {","+  if (id === '__root__') {","+    return `import { createRootRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+","+export const Route = createRootRoute()","+`","+  }","+  return `import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'","+","+export const Route = createFileRoute('${id}')()","+`","+}","+","+async function generate(files: Record<string, string>) {","+  tempDir = await fs.mkdtemp(","+    path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'tsr-generator-childless-layout-'),","+  )","+  const routesDirectory = path.join(tempDir, 'routes')","+  for (const [file, id] of Object.entries(files)) {","+    const filePath = path.join(routesDirectory, file)","+    await fs.mkdir(path.dirname(filePath), { recursive: true })","+    await fs.writeFile(filePath, routeSource(id))","+  }","+  const generatedRouteTree = path.join(tempDir, 'routeTree.gen.ts')","+  const generator = new Generator({","+    config: getConfig(","+      {","+        disableLogging: true,","+        routesDirectory,","+        generatedRouteTree,","+        tmpDir: path.join(tempDir, 'tmp'),","+      },","+      tempDir,","+    ),","+    root: tempDir,","+  })","+  await generator.run()","+  return fs.readFile(generatedRouteTree, 'utf-8')","+}","+","+// A route group's layout without child routes yet next to the index route","+// generates, as before route-group layouts were typed with the full path `/`.","+describe('a route-group layout without child routes yet next to the index route', () => {","+  it.each([","+    { file: '(group)/_layout.tsx', id: '/(group)/_layout' },","+    { file: '(marketing)/route.tsx', id: '/(marketing)' },","+  ])('$file is added to the route tree', async ({ file, id }) => {","+    const routeTree = await generate({","+      '__root.tsx': '__root__',","+      'index.tsx': '/',","+      [file]: id,","+    })","+","+    expect(routeTree).toContain(`'${id}': typeof`)","+  })","+})","+","+// The route tree lists the index route first, and the router then matches","+// `/` to a pathless layout without child routes instead of the index route.","+// The generator refuses that pair rather than hide the index route.","+test('a pathless layout without child routes yet conflicts with the index route', async () => {","+  await expect(","+    generate({","+      '__root.tsx': '__root__',","+      'index.tsx': '/',","+      '_auth.tsx': '/_auth',","+    }),","+  ).rejects.toThrow(","+    'Conflicting configuration paths were found for the following routes: \"/\", \"/\".',","+  )","+})","+","+// A pathless layout whose parent directory has no route file of its own","+// (`foo/_layout.tsx` without `foo.tsx`) carries that directory's path, so it","+// matches `/foo` like any other route there.","+describe('a layout without child routes yet that adds a path', () => {","+  it.each([","+    { file: '(group)/foo.tsx', id: '/(group)/foo' },","+    { file: 'foo_.tsx', id: '/foo_' },","+  ])('conflicts with $file at the same full path', async ({ file, id }) => {","+    await expect(","+      generate({","+        '__root.tsx': '__root__',","+        'foo/_layout.tsx': '/foo/_layout',","+        [file]: id,","+      }),","+    ).rejects.toThrow(","+      'Conflicting configuration paths were found for the following routes: \"/foo\", \"/foo\".',","+    )","+  })","+})"],"additions":107,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/router-generator/tests/generator/nested-route-groups-with-layouts-before-physical/routeTree.snapshot.ts","lines":["@@ -51,16 +51,16 @@ const groupCLayoutCIndexRoute = groupCLayoutCIndexRouteImport.update({"," } as any)"," "," export interface FileRoutesByFullPath {","+  '/': typeof groupCLayoutCIndexRoute","   '/login': typeof groupALayoutALoginRoute","   '/signup': typeof groupALayoutASignupRoute","   '/dashboard': typeof groupBLayoutBDashboardRoute","-  '/': typeof groupCLayoutCIndexRoute"," }"," export interface FileRoutesByTo {","+  '/': typeof groupCLayoutCIndexRoute","   '/login': typeof groupALayoutALoginRoute","   '/signup': typeof groupALayoutASignupRoute","   '/dashboard': typeof groupBLayoutBDashboardRoute","-  '/': typeof groupCLayoutCIndexRoute"," }"," export interface FileRoutesById {","   __root__: typeof rootRouteImport","@@ -74,9 +74,9 @@ export interface FileRoutesById {"," }"," export interface FileRouteTypes {","   fileRoutesByFullPath: FileRoutesByFullPath","-  fullPaths: '/login' | '/signup' | '/dashboard' | '/'","+  fullPaths: '/' | '/login' | '/signup' | '/dashboard'","   fileRoutesByTo: FileRoutesByTo","-  to: '/login' | '/signup' | '/dashboard' | '/'","+  to: '/' | '/login' | '/signup' | '/dashboard'","   id:","     | '__root__'","     | '/(group-a)/_layout-a'","@@ -99,21 +99,21 @@ declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {","     '/(group-a)/_layout-a': {","       id: '/(group-a)/_layout-a'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupALayoutARouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }","     '/(group-b)/_layout-b': {","       id: '/(group-b)/_layout-b'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupBLayoutBRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }","     '/(group-c)/_layout-c': {","       id: '/(group-c)/_layout-c'","       path: ''","-      fullPath: ''","+      fullPath: '/'","       preLoaderRoute: typeof groupCLayoutCRouteImport","       parentRoute: typeof rootRouteImport","     }"],"additions":7,"deletions":7,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/router-generator/tests/generator/route-groups/routeTree.snapshot.ts","lines":["@@ -76,6 +76,7 @@ const fooAsdfbarLayoutXyzLazyRoute = fooAsdfbarLayoutXyzLazyRouteImport","   )"," "," export interface FileRoutesByFullPath {","+  '/': typeof barBarRouteWithChildren","   '/hello': typeof barBarHelloRoute","   '/asdf': typeof fooAsdfanotherGroupLayoutRouteWithChildren","   '/asdf/$id': typeof fooAsdfbarIdRoute","@@ -85,6 +86,7 @@ export interface FileRoutesByFullPath {","   '/asdf/xyz': typeof fooAsdfbarLayoutXyzLazyRoute"," }"," export interface FileRoutesByTo {","+  '/': typeof barBarRouteWithChildren","   '/hello': typeof barBarHelloRoute","   '/asdf': typeof fooAsdfanotherGroupLayoutRouteWithChildren","   '/asdf/$id': typeof fooAsdfbarIdRoute","@@ -108,6 +110,7 @@ export interface FileRoutesById {"," export interface FileRouteTypes {","   fileRoutesByFullPath: FileRoutesByFullPath","   fullPaths:","+    | '/'","     | '/hello'","     | '/asdf'","     | '/asdf/$id'","@@ -117,6 +120,7 @